# PixelLog Cinema Exposure False Color 3D LUT
# Calibrated for Pixel-Log 18% Middle Grey at 0.4000
# Purple: <2% Black Clip | Blue: 2-8% Deep Shadow | Teal: 8-20% Low Shadow
# Green: 36-44% (18% Grey @ 40%) | Pink: 52-62% Skin Tones
# Yellow: 75-85% Highlight Caution | Orange: 85-95% Critical | Red: >95% Clip
